      "statement": "The final external-action dispatch boundary resolves and cross-checks the authoritative Run and WorkItem before connector contract lookup, claim, call-start, or execution; dry_run is terminally denied and audited with zero connector calls, dispatch attempts, or receipts, while mock_execution retains the controlled connector path.",
